Z||000012||jimmybpei||12-04-2001||12:47 PM||||hutch- as for the front blackouts they are just a flat piece of tinted plexi glass with a couple of bent sheet metal supports 3m 2way taped on the buper cover and then  2 way taped the plexi to the metal. Very very easy and cheap to do. Give me your address and i will mail you a paper template.<P>Rockcrawl- Looking for one of those front chins but they are too big to ship to canada from IRM. i even told them to cut it in half, but they would'nt. Think you can hook  me up with one by the time i get to PA for the car show in the spring or maybe in daytona.<P>Nocones- Tahnks for the compliment on the car but it isnt even done yet. As for the wing " oh  well" everyone is entitled to their own opinion. Any way this car i built for my girlfriend to drive and race next summer. Like to see her in the cadero beat up on some mustangs.<P>Later.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jimmybpeisig_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
